@startuml
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title WebLLM Inference Flow (Prefill → Decode)
' URL:   https://webllm.mlc.ai/
' URL:   https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.15803
' Level: n/a (substrate)

actor User
component "Tokenizer" as Tokenizer <<app>>
component "Prefill Phase\n(Process Prompt)" as Prefill <<host>>
component "Decode Phase\n(Generate Tokens)" as Decode <<host>>
component "Detokenizer" as Detokenizer <<app>>

User ARROW_MAIN Tokenizer : Raw Text Prompt
Tokenizer ARROW_MAIN Prefill : Token IDs
Prefill ARROW_MAIN Decode : KV Cache & Context
Decode ARROW_OPTIONAL Decode : Autoregressive Generation\n(Token by Token)
Decode ARROW_MAIN Detokenizer : New Token ID
Detokenizer ARROW_MAIN User : Streamed Text

note bottom of Decode
  Two-phase transformer inference: **prefill**
  processes the whole prompt in one pass and fills
  the KV cache; **decode** then emits one token per
  step, reusing that cache. WebGPU runs both.
end note
@enduml
